# Frame_Slot - a socket in the HUD that holds one 32x32 ball icon (the ball queue).
# 40x40, Sliced, border 4 on every side: the whole frame is 4 px, the centre (4..35) is flat and sits under the ball.
# Light from the top-left: the gold rim is lit on the top/left sides and in shade on the bottom/right (the corner
# chamfer splits it into four mitred sides); the socket is sunk into the panel, so its top and left inner walls are
# in shadow and its bottom and right walls catch the light. The floor is darker than the panel so the ball pops.
size 40 40
key
  K #0a0c18  ink (outer line)
  G #e8a830  gold rim, lit sides
  D #a8661a  gold rim, shade sides
  X #5c360c  gold deep line (rim meets the socket)
  f #0c1228  socket wall in shadow (top, left)
  c #1f2c56  socket wall catching light (bottom, right)
  e #111936  socket floor
strokes
  line K 2 0 37 0 39 2 39 37 37 39 2 39 0 37 0 2 2 0
  rect X 2 2 37 37
seeds
  G 12 1 1 12
  D 12 38 38 12
  e 20 20
ops
  band e c 0 1 1
  band e c 1 0 1
  band e f 0 -1 1
  band e f -1 0 1
